window.products.push({"id":1102096,"name":"Spaas Tealights Bag x50, 8 Hours, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gUCiAa8PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What Makes A House A \"Home\"? Spaas, The Candle Experience Have you ever wondered why candles and tea lights are so popular?  Candles are perhaps one of the most enjoyable and affordable luxury items available to everyone.Nothing changes the atmosphere of a room like lighting, and candlelight offers probably the warmest and softest lighting options of all. These tea lights feature approximately 7 to 8 hours of burn time and are ideal to create that home's mood. - Burn beautifully and don't flicker  - Burn fully and evenly  - Wicks have no afterglow, do not smoulder and are easy to relight Enjoy The Light! Whether you use these tea lights for a wedding, a party or to decorate your house, enjoy the atmosphere during those cosy dark winter evenings or the eternally lasting summer nights. 160 Years Of Family Tradition And Experience With a family tradition of almost 160 years , production and distribution of high quality candles is one of the cornerstones of Spaas' business philosophy. Spaas is ISO 9001:2000 certified. Spaas' candles undergo stringent quality control tests on a daily basis. Our materials do not contain any substances that are harmful for health or the environment. - Produced by Top 3 European manufacturer  - Burn 7-8 hours  - BRC Consumer Products Certificated We guarantee you consistently high quality, security and safety. Delivering perfect results to our customer ... that is our passion! Click the button at the top of this page so that you can enjoy the ambiance that our candles provide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gUCiAa8PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivyline","source_asin":"B008BI8ULY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BI8ULY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BI8ULY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1102097,"name":"Lori Mitchell Tom and Goodie on Gobbler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61goHD5HXuL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Created by ESC Trading for the Lori Mitchell Collection. Designer: Lori Mitchell - Tom & Goodie on Gobblers Item # 92295 - Resin & Paper Pulp & Metal - 9 inches tall each - Set of 2 Lori Mitchell was born and raised in Marietta, Georgia. A graduate of the Rhode Island School of Design, Lori has always been inspired by children's themes and literature, old illustrations and toys. In 1999 she began making her first paper mache pieces for the folk art world and has never looked back. Full of whimsy and charm, her characters have won a place in the hearts and collections of folk art enthusiasts worldwide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61goHD5HXuL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lori Mitchell","source_asin":"B00BF651PC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BF651PC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BF651PC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
