window.products.push({"id":1102253,"name":"Music Light Bluetooth Speaker Double-Wall Vacuum Flask Insulated 316 Stainless Steel Water Bottle With Temperature display ,Wide Mouth,Keeps Hot and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AIBNMLZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Vacuum Insulated] Stainless steel sports water bottle is double wall insulated and vacuum sealed with inner stainless steel lining to keep your beverages cold for up 24 hours and hot for 12 hours. Wide mouth of the bottle is very convenient for you drink. This superior design ensures your bottle will never leak. You can enjoy cold water or hot drinks ,such as juice,milk,,coffee,tea,beer or whatever you like in everyday. [ 316 Food Grade Stainless Steel] 316 Stainless steel water bottle is BPA free,made of 316 food grade stainless steel is high quality which will never rust and break.also easy to clean and scratch resistant(capacity：11.83oz).The appearance and design looks very high-end. The insulated water bottle is a great gift for any occasion for family , friends or kids. [ Tech Function]When you touch the cap of surface,It will be show the temperature about the bottle inside water.Our water bottle's design is very humanized and safe. Especially for the elder and children.When the water bottle is powered on, It will automatically flash for 5 times every 1 hours for remindering to replenish water . Remind you drink enough water and protect your health. [ Music and Light Function]Our music light water bottle can play music via bluetooth and also have 8 light modes for your choices to display via app. Also the music and light can be performed at the same time.The low light mode suit for help breastfeeding, sleeping and waking up at night. The high light mode suit for changing diaper, reading, illumine. And you could even control the brightness from 0%-100% to your desired lighting.Switching the light color by the buttons or APP control. [ Wide applications] The insulated water bottle can use for indoor and outdoor.Such as hiking,picnic,fitness, driving, schooling,office and tent light ,etc Excellent gift for yourself ,kid, colleague,friends ,relatives and families for daily ,christmas ,New year,father day,mother day and every festival.Turn on the power light to remind water replenishment standby time:5 days. Music playback continues flight time:18 hours.These bring pleasure to your work and travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AIBNMLZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heart Tong","source_asin":"B09P73PN9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P73PN9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P73PN9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
