window.products.push({"id":1102295,"name":"La Rochere for French Home 'Eiffel' Tower Goblet Tumbler, 8.5-Ounce, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41otgR5mL5L._AC_.jpg","description":"La Rochere has been producing artisanal glass in the heart of France for more than 500 years, making it the oldest continuously running glass factory in Europe. The company is recognized around the world for designing and producing authentic, high quality glassware with French style for today’s modern home. Nestled in the forests of the Lorraine and Franche-Comté region of France, La Rochere produces all of its glassware in-house. Surrounding forests provide natural materials needed to fuse the glass, such as silica sand and soil, along with firewood and ferns to heat the furnaces. Using a custom manufacturing process, La Rochere pieces are created with a two-part open mold, giving them the brand’s iconic seam. The result is superior quality glass, known for its exceptional clarity, brilliance, durability and authentic French style. Updated for today’s lifestyles, all La Rochere glass is dishwasher safe. La Rochere designers and glass artisans collaborate to create fresh designs for daily living and special occasions. Inspired by French cuisine, culture, art and style, each piece evokes both casual comfort and modern elegance. Designers also take inspiration from the company’s historic archives, adding classic charm to contemporary patterns and silhouettes. La Rochere has captured a loyal following worldwide with signature collections such as the best-selling Napoleon Bee collection, the beloved Versailles collection, and the distinctive Lyonnais collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41otgR5mL5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Rochere (LARAO","source_asin":"B00E4BQKHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E4BQKHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E4BQKHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
