window.products.push({"id":1102335,"name":"Pure 24K Gold Dipped Real Rose Lasting Forever for Mother's Day Gift & Anniversary (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P6AfbiT3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Valentine's Day Gift - Are you looking for a gift of distinction and class that is guaranteed to last a lifetime? Our exquisite roses are the perfect symbol of your love and commitment to that special someone in your life and makes a perfect Valentine's Gift. 100% Real Rose - We only use the finest and 100% real hand-picked roses. Skilled Craftsmanship. Real Rose. Pure 24K Gold. Each rose goes over a meticulous 65 steps process by skilled artisans. Unmatched Process & Quality - Our technicians carefully select for quality and shape to capture it's natural beauty forever. It is then preserved and lined with precious 24K Gold including the stems of the rose, petals, leaves, sepals and thorns. Luxury Packaging - Our packaging is the best in the market and speaks \"luxury\" as soon you see it. Each box includes - 24K Gold Plated Rose, cleaning cloth for the rose, a personalized message card for your loved one, gold plated guarantee certificate and a user manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P6AfbiT3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ForeverMoments","source_asin":"B081FJTN1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081FJTN1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081FJTN1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1102336,"name":"Emile Henry Butter Pot, Azur, 7-Oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614RcDfYTAL._AC_SL1205_.jpg","description":"Marcigny, a small town nestled between the hills of Southern Burgundy, has been home to Emile Henry for the past 150 years. Faithful to its origins, the entire production is carried out here. Thanks to its clay, rich in refractory properties, Burgundy has remained a fertile area for potters, passing on their savoir-faire from generation to generation. Clay, a natural and noble material, has been used since the mists of the time to cook or preserve food. While respecting the traditional techniques, Emile Henry has introduced technological improvements (Ceradon ) so that the dishes are more resistant to mechanical and thermal shock. Strong and durable, all Emile Henry pieces can be taken directly from the freezer to a hot oven, can go under a broiler and are microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The natural clay is unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. All pieces are perfect for everyday use and carry a 3 year warranty against defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614RcDfYTAL._AC_SL1205_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B000XB4QEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XB4QEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XB4QEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1102337,"name":"Koyal Wholesale 5 Arm Metal Candelabra Candle Holder Centerpiece, 12\" Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LK-K7ca7L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP. Crafted of nickel-plated iron metal (of iron in beautiful matte gold finish) Constructed with a durable and stable base. Classic 5 arm taper candle candelabra. Excellent taper candle holder candelabrum available in short or tall sizes. 5-ARM CANDELABRA. Available in gold and silver Can hold taper candles with diameter of 21mm. Candles are not included. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL USE. Pair with Koyal glass peg hurricane votive candle holders (sold separately) to safely hold votive candles or battery operated tealights. Check out our collection of Koyal glass hurricance peg candle holders for best fit. ASSEMBLY AND CARE. Easy assembly required. Candelabra assembly instructions are included. Simple, regular care needed, spot clean with a soft cloth. Do not use abrasives or harsh chemicals. Not dishwasher safe. SIZE DIMENSIONS: 12 inches tall. Each arm is 6 inches long (from center), base diameter 4.2 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LK-K7ca7L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koyal Wholesale","source_asin":"B071GMBZ94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071GMBZ94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071GMBZ94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1102338,"name":"Vacuum Sealer and Digital Kitchen Scale with Premium LED Screen, Viotte Automatic Vacuum Air Sealing System for Food Preservation and Food Weight Meas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W1EKvofcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose Viotte Vacuum Sealing System ? ViotteVS6600M Vacuum food sealer is powerful and easy to use. Its heavy-duty construction and top of the line performance make it efficient to keep foods fresher longer and prevent freezer burn. Kitchen scale design makes it easier to weigh things anytime and anywhere because it can be powered by 2 AAA batteries(not included in packages) without plugging power cord in . Moreover, digital scale is removable. Seal/vacuum seal is practical. Dry/moist food and normal/gentle speed mode to choose according to the goods you need to vacuum seal. You can also enjoy your self-driving tour with the vacuum sealer because it has AC and DC ports. You can power this appliance by plugging DC power cord into the cigartte lighter.  With attached vacuum hose, you can short press the red button in the side of the sealer to extract air from vacuum bottles or long press this button to use the pickling function. Built-in slicer is convenient to cut bags to the size as you like. The Vacuum Sealer can keep non-food items from air and moisture like silver(keep the luster), travel supplies(keep dry and in order) and other valuables. Notes: 1.In order to seal well do not fill bags too full. 2.Make sure the bag mouse is dry and flat. 3.Do not put foods with vacuum bags into microwave oven to heat. 4.When constantly use, please cool down it for about 60 seconds to prevent overheating. 5.The maximum weight is 2kg. Digtal scale and vacuum sealer function can't be used at the same time. When using other container to weigh liquid or powder food, please press the \"Tare\" button. Press the \"Mode\" button to convert weight unit(g,kg,oz,lb). 6.The DC port can only be connected with 12V current. Package contents: ·1 x Vacuum Sealer  ·1 x User Manual ·1 x Power cord ·10 x vacuum bags  ·1 x long vacuum bag roll  ·1 x vacuum hose","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W1EKvofcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viotte","source_asin":"B075V4FBM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075V4FBM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075V4FBM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
