window.products.push({"id":1102515,"name":"Preserved Real Rose Enchanted Real Rose Flower with Love Heart I Love You Necklace 100 Languages Gift Set,Handmade Eternal Flesh Flower Rose Gift for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813taJXGH2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Great Gift for Birthdays, Anniversary, Valentines Day, and Christmas. Declare Your Undying Love in 100 Different Ways. The Ideal present for that special someone in your life – a Mom, Sister, Best Friends, Girlfriends, Wife, Daughter, and / or Secret Admirer. The eternal flower that can remain beautiful for more than 3 years represents \"eternal love\", \"eternal happiness\" and \"beautiful eternal\". Sending eternal flowers to girls on Valentine's Day is not only an expression of love, but also a promise of \"to stay together for a lifetime\". If you are looking for a unique way to let that special person in your life know that you love them, then this “100 languages I love you necklace” and the preserved rose set is sure to do the trick.  I Love You Necklace 100 languages - using the latest in Nano Projection Technology. Show her how much you Love her and make her fall in Love all over How to protect the preserved rose: Keep preserved flower away from direct sunlight and high and humid temperature, you can enjoy its beauty as long as you can. Preserved Flower Care Do not place flowers in excessive heat or strong light. Immortal roses are very delicate, please do not touch them frequently. Do not water, do not place outdoors, and do not expose to direct sunlight. If it is covered with dust, use a hair dryer with cold air to gently blow off the dust. If the room is humid, do not expose the flowers to the air for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813taJXGH2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RongDX","source_asin":"B08SL9N425","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SL9N425","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SL9N425","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
