window.products.push({"id":1102517,"name":"RONCHEN Soap Dish,Premium Soap Dish for Shower, Space Aluminum Wall Mounted Bar Soap Holder for Bathroom Shower Kitchen Wall, Drilling Installation or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uGVfdJ7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still worried about the soap nowhere to put it？  Are you still worried about the soap that melts in the bath?  Let RONCHEN soap holder solve your worries. Product Specifications Product material: space aluminum Product Size: 5×3.5×1 inch product weight：3.68 Ounces Package includes: 1 soap holder  2 Strong stickers  2 expansion screws  1 special wrench  1 copy of installation instructions Paste installation instructions 1. Powerful stickers can be used on flat and smooth surfaces such as ceramic tiles, stainless steel, glass, wood, marble, etc., and cannot be used on painted walls, wallpapered walls, cement walls, lime walls， and other uneven surfaces. Where there are big gaps.in 2. Clean the place to be installed first and keep it dry. 3. Remove the screws on the sticker, and then install them into the reserved holes of the soap box. 4. Tear off the bottom paper of the sticker, stick the soap box on the cleaned place, unscrew the screws after sticking, and remove the soap holder. Squeeze out the air in the patch. 5. Install the soap box and tighten the screws with the small wrench provided. 6. The patch can only be installed once and cannot be reused. Make sure not to move after installation. Hole installation 1. Press the soap box on the wall to be installed, and mark the two holes of the soap box with a marker. 2. After drilling the hole with a 6mm drill bit, drive into the plastic expansion tube. Then use the supplied screws to install the soap box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uGVfdJ7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RONCHEN","source_asin":"B08ZYVLN92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYVLN92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYVLN92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
