window.products.push({"id":1102532,"name":"Jolitac 16 inch Artificial Wreath Green Leaf with Rattan Base Weaving, Handmade Eucalyptus, Cotton Flowers, Sunflower, Rose, Flower Wreathes for Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSbNTIZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DESIGN AND HANDCRAFT - - This unique wreath design weaves full spring greenery, bountiful faux white flower, versatile green leaves that will bring new life to your home. Set on a natural, thick grapevine wreath base. Each wreath is handmade with high attention to detail and workmanship for design quality you can't find in retail stores. SOLID WORKMANSHIP - - Measures: Diameter 16inch. These greenery leaves are double fixed on the rattan frame base, (if leaves falling off due to shipping, just insert it back to base, because the leaves are detachable). It is a gorgeous creation leaves and cotton stems are highly adjustable and can be easily adjusted to a satisfied look. WIDE APPLICATION OF SCENES - - The decor wreaths are suitable for all year use, always keep green, vivid natural form, giving people artistic romantic feelings hanging indoor or outdoor make it a versatile decorating accessory. Also place it on your doors, windows, bedroom, kitchen, wedding, party, or on a living room wall, adds a little element of nature. A PERFECT GIFT - - Ideal gift for your friends and families on housewarming day, birthday, thanksgiving, Christmas and any other festivals. The wreath will bring an enjoyable ambiance all year round. If this wreath does not satisfy you well, please feel free to contact us, then we will give you a satisfy solution. DECORATIVE SUNFLOWER WREATH - - This yellow wreath create a lively look that makes for a wonderful style, can use it every season! Elegant and vivid color make for a timeless seasonal home décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSbNTIZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jolitac","source_asin":"B08CZKBNM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZKBNM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZKBNM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1102533,"name":"The Juiceman Electronic Professional Series 410 Elite Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4174K00G32L.jpg","description":"Product Description Features patented built-in speed control for optimum juice extraction. Large feed tube allows for faster juicing. Easy clean-up, use a common grocery pulp bag as liner for the detachable pulp basket. Amazon.com Whether you're into nutrition-laden wheatgrass tonics or really superb fresh orange juice, a juicer is a great way to go. Fruits and vegetables are an essential part of a healthy diet, and additive-free fresh juice is a convenient and quick alternative to eating all of them whole. This professional-quality Juiceman makes the process very quick for the serious juice enthusiast. A few simple twists attach and detach the juice bowl, blade basket, and cover to and from the base unit, which has a footprint comparable to the average blender. Produce cut to the appropriate size goes in the feed tube, then is gently pressed into the blade basket with a plunger. Juice pours out one spout and the pulp--including seeds and skin--shoots out into a separate pulp basket. It has two speed settings, low for softer produce such as oranges and apples and high for harder fruits and vegetables such as carrots and pineapples--in practice this unit is plenty powerful enough to almost instantly go through baby carrots at low speed. Enjoy the juice and use the pulp in recipes such as those for carrot cake. A basic cookbook and audiotape of juicing tips are included. --Dale Steinke","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4174K00G32L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juiceman","source_asin":"B00004R93V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004R93V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004R93V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
