window.products.push({"id":1102571,"name":"Ivation 1800W 5.5QT Electric Air Fryer with Digital LED Touch Display Featuring 7 Cooking Presets Menu, Timer and Temperature Control - for Healthy Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Me31b1uzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’re minutes away from healthy, grease-free food. The Ivation High-Power Multifunction Air Fryer is the fast, easy way to prepare delicious fried foods quickly, with little or no messy oil. Using a rapid hot air circulation system, the fryer cooks foods to perfection at the precise temperature. Several popular food presets are included. In the box you’ll find suggested settings for numerous popular food items. From fries to meats to poultry to snacks to baked goods, there is a lot to love about what this air fryer can do. Now you can serve the family with minimal effort or preparation. Precision temperature range control. Set the exact cooking time and temperature for any food you want to prepare – at the touch of a button. With 1800W of power, the Ivation Air Fyer is remarkably effective at keeping steady temperatures throughout the entire cooking process. Smart Air Circulation for Even Heating Utilizing an effective rapid air circulation pattern, this air fryer evenly distributes the hot air around the food. With every pass, the food is gradually brought closer to the final temperature. This results in a perfect cook. Slide-Out Pan w/Detachable Basket For some foods, a little shake at the halfway-ready point achieves a crispier result. The frying pan therefore slides out from the rest of the unit, and the 5.2L non-stick basket is also detachable from the pan for easy dispensing of ready food. Auto-Off, Ready Alert & Built-in Timer Once the cooking process is started, you can let the air fryer work on its own – no need to monitor it or adjust the heat. It features double overheating protection circuits, a timer that can be set up to 60 minutes, when the food is ready, the fryer shuts off automatically and emits an audible alert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Me31b1uzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B076MPFJM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MPFJM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MPFJM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
