window.products.push({"id":1102748,"name":"CANMOV Dual Motor Large Power Lift Recliner Chairs with Massage and Heat for Elderly Big People, Electric Faux Leather Recliner with Adjustable Headre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":589.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SwnfKw35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extended Backrest & Deeper Seat: By analyzing the physical traits of big people, we designed a wide power lift recliner chair that is most suitable for most American seniors.The backrest length of 25 inches is suitable for most people. The depth of seat 24 inches can provide perfect support for your entire hips and legs. Tips: If you have any concerns regarding your health, consult your doctor before using the product. Power Lift Recliner Chair: You can press the side button to control the lift or recline of the recliner chair, which means you can get any position you want, whether it's reclining between 110-150 degrees or lifting. The lift chair is powered by electric motor mechanism to push the entire chair up, working smoothly and silently to help the elderly stand up easily. It’s also ideal for people who have balance problems with legs or back, or who after surgery. Adjustable Headrest: The large lift chair designed with electrically adjustable headrest,The headrest can be adjusted by the side button easily, which can help you relax your neck muscles and provide you the perfect angles for your rest. Massage & Lumbar Heat: Equipped with 4 powerful massage parts (back, lumbar, thighs, legs) and 5 massage modes for selection, each massage point can be operated individually. There is timer function in 15/30/60 minutes which is convenient for you to set massaging time. Add 1 lumbar heat point to promote blood circulation throughout your body, providing a full body relaxation! USB Charging Ports & Concealed Cup Holders: The lift chair has a USB outlet that keep your devices charging and dual side pockets for small items within reach, 2 concealed cup holders offer you wonderful home theatering experience. (Notes: The USB ports ONLY for low-power devices, such as iPhone, iPad.) Easy Assembly & Service: The lift chair comes with 3 boxes, we send out the boxes at the same time, but they may not arrive at the same time, please start installing after receiving all boxes. It takes only several steps to assemble this power lift chair and NO TOOLS. CANMOV provide free exchange for installation problems, damaged and missing parts with 1-year warranty guarantee, feel free to contact us for any purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SwnfKw35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANMOV","source_asin":"B0BWJVM64K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJVM64K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJVM64K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
