window.products.push({"id":1102797,"name":"Kids Alarm Clock,Night Light for Kids, 5 Ringtones,Touch Control and Digital Thermometer,Sleep Timer with 2000mAh Rechargeable Clocks for kids room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ydpOsOjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【Multi-function kids alarm clock】This cute bunny alarm clock has a soft night light with 3 timers, 2 alarms with snooze modes, 6 music to choose from, a thermometer, 5 levels of adjustable volume, and a countdown function. ⏰【Wake up early & night light】-If you or your children are afraid of dark night, you can set 30min,60min timed night light or 60min breath light to accompany the sleep. If the alarm clock is set before 0:00-8:00 am, the soft light will slowly light up 10mins before the alarm sounds, letting you wake up naturally. ⏰【2 Alarm sets & snoozes mode】You can set 2 different alarm clocks to adapt to your needs. if you want to sleep a little longer, you just need to shake the alarm clock, it will ring again after 5min. You can also display the screen by touching, shake or making a sound louder than 56 dB, it will go out automatically 15 seconds later. ⏰【Easy to place & Rechargeable Battery】: This alarm clock has a magnetic function on the backside that can be attached to other places. It has a built-in battery, you can use it wirelessly, move and place at will, it easily ensures safety for your kids' room. It has 2 modes for you to switch time or temperature display. ⏰【Kids Sleep Trainer & Gift】This wake-up clock uses eco-friendly silicone that is soft and safe for children and adults. Help your kids to develop a regular sleep habit, learn to sleep alone and tell time. A cute rabbit design is a unique gift and decor for back to school, birthday, holiday, and Christmas. If you have any questions about this product, please contact us directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ydpOsOjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUYE","source_asin":"B0B8MYS822","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MYS822","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MYS822","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
