window.products.push({"id":1102878,"name":"Northlight 28 Pre-Lit Windsor Pine Artificial Christmas Swag - Clear Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hMmggEHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the hustle and bustle of the holiday season who has time for tedious decorating? Make your decorating a breeze with this deluxe pre-lit artificial Windsor pine Christmas swag. Perfect for hanging on doors, walls, banisters, window ledges and mantelpieces. Product Features:. Pre-lit with 50 clear mini lights. 58 tips. 1.5\" wide tapered tips. 30\" green lead cord. Bendable wire branches allow for you to easily shape the swag and accommodate your decorating needs. Green hooks at the top for easy hanging Additional Product Features:. Light sets on the swag are UL listed for indoor or outdoor use, however the swag itself is recommended for indoor use or outdoors under a covered area. Contains 1 plug with end connector which allows you to stack multiple lighted items together (not to exceed 210 watts). No assembly required – swag comes in 1 piece. Comes with replacement bulbs and spare fuse. Wire gauge: 22. 120 volts, 60 hertz, 0.17 amps, 20.4 watts Dimensions: 28\" long x 21\" wide. Material(s): PVC/glass bulbs/wire/metalNote: Branches are compressed for shipment, and need to be fluffed out upon arrival to look like the photo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hMmggEHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B0763V7V75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1102878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0763V7V75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0763V7V75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
