window.products.push({"id":1103001,"name":"Syalife Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Absorbs Heat to Keep Body Cool for Night Sweats, Revolutionary Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber Q-Max>0.5, Ultra-Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bbtEaGqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep You Cool All Night】Even in hot summer weather, Syalife revolutionary Japanese Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber blanket(Q-Max 0.5) can brilliantly absorb your body heat, to reduce skin temperature by 2 to 5°C instantly (Traditional Bamboo fiber Q-Max is only 0.3). This blanket can make you cool and comfortable all night— no sticky feeling! 【Revolutionary Japanese Cooling Fabric 】Weaved with advanced Arc-Chill cool yarn, our blanket can quickly transfer body heat from skin to fabric surface and quickly evaporate. So it makes skin feel dry and comfortable, very suitable for hot summer. In addition, revolutionary Japanese graphene cool fabric help to maintain skin moisture and elasticity. 【Double-sided Design】Mica nylon & polyester on the front side is breathable for hot summer use, which keeps you cool and dry by absorbing and dispersing unnecessary body heat. Skin-friendly 100% mica nylon on the reverse side is comfy for spring & autumn use. 【Soft and Breathable】Lighter than a comforter, it is designed to offer you comfortable sleep by using advanced Arc-Chill technology, breathable materials, and lightweight construction. Our Syalife cooling blanket for hot sleepers is breathable, soft and snuggly. 【Easy to Care】The cooling blanket measures 90\" x 108\". Hand wash or machine wash on gentle cycle with cold water separately. We recommend putting it in a laundry bag to avoid knotting or hooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bbtEaGqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Syalife","source_asin":"B0C8JFQSCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8JFQSCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8JFQSCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
